WEBVTT

00:00:31.489 --> 00:00:33.867
No... I don't believe in fate.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.244
What's important is who we are now...

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:38.455
Zessica...

00:00:38.455 --> 00:00:42.500
W-Well, I kinda got to the shop too late.

00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:44.669
They were all sold out of Yakisoba bread!

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:47.088
Um... Zessica...

00:00:48.506 --> 00:00:50.300
Well...

00:00:50.300 --> 00:00:54.512
About what you said before
Aquarion went out of control...

00:00:54.512 --> 00:00:56.014
I'm in love with you, Amata.

00:00:57.515 --> 00:01:00.518
I... well...

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.397
--Right now, Mikono is...
--I got it! You don't have to say it!

00:01:05.690 --> 00:01:07.942
I'm okay.

00:01:07.942 --> 00:01:11.905
I kinda figured that was the case, so...

00:01:11.905 --> 00:01:13.073
See you later!

00:01:13.073 --> 00:01:14.783
Wait, Zessica!

00:01:22.290 --> 00:01:24.709
Mikono...

00:01:24.709 --> 00:01:28.838
S... Sorry... to interrupt.

00:01:31.049 --> 00:01:33.218
H-Hold on!

00:01:33.218 --> 00:01:35.595
Mikono! You've got the wrong idea!

00:01:40.558 --> 00:01:42.352
Mikono!

00:01:46.898 --> 00:01:51.027
Having put them through the
Grave Training and the battle sim,

00:01:51.027 --> 00:01:53.530
isn't now the right time?

00:01:53.530 --> 00:01:55.031
Yeah.

00:01:55.031 --> 00:01:58.243
Maybe it's about time to dig up that thing...

00:02:01.371 --> 00:02:05.875
<i>You're so beautiful it's depressing</i>

00:02:05.875 --> 00:02:13.925
<i>Let's love each other platonically</i>
<i>in this topsy-turvy world</i>

00:02:20.181 --> 00:02:30.567
<i>The world we're looking at</i>
<i>is always upside down</i>

00:02:30.567 --> 00:02:39.534
<i>We don't have control</i>
<i>over how things get decided</i>

00:02:39.534 --> 00:02:45.165
<i>You're so hurt that your eyes are in tears</i>

00:02:45.165 --> 00:02:51.421
<i>I stayed silent while my heart cried out</i>

00:02:51.421 --> 00:03:03.516
<i>While the last two were kept apart,</i>
<i>the countdown has started</i>

00:03:03.516 --> 00:03:08.146
<i>You're so beautiful it's depressing</i>

00:03:08.146 --> 00:03:14.027
<i>Let's love each other like animals</i>
<i>on the verge of extinction</i>

00:03:14.027 --> 00:03:18.531
<i>You're so beautiful it makes me wanna cry</i>

00:03:18.531 --> 00:03:24.621
<i>I want to feel a platonic love</i>
<i>in this topsy-turvy world</i>

00:03:32.087 --> 00:03:35.507
"Well Up, Life"

00:03:37.258 --> 00:03:39.386
I guess I got rejected.

00:03:42.514 --> 00:03:45.266
Say... about what happened this afternoon...

00:03:45.266 --> 00:03:48.019
...you might've kinda gotten
the wrong idea, but...

00:03:55.735 --> 00:03:58.613
I changed my mind. It's nothing.

00:04:01.658 --> 00:04:05.078
Romance is prohibited!
There's something wrong with everyone!

00:04:05.078 --> 00:04:08.790
There were even casualties in the last battle,

00:04:08.790 --> 00:04:11.042
so why is everyone thinking about romance?!

00:04:11.042 --> 00:04:12.961
Yeah, I know what you're saying.

00:04:14.212 --> 00:04:18.341
But it's also true that precisely because
we're side-by-side with death like this,

00:04:18.341 --> 00:04:21.511
it makes us want to experience passionate love.

00:04:21.511 --> 00:04:24.597
That's what you call human instinct.

00:04:24.597 --> 00:04:28.560
You're trying to pass on your genes
because you're facing mortal danger.

00:04:28.560 --> 00:04:30.061
Genes...

00:04:30.061 --> 00:04:32.063
Are you talking about
a Gattai with real bodies?!

00:04:32.063 --> 00:04:36.860
I'm not talking about that!
Rather, I'm talking about pure love!

00:04:46.745 --> 00:04:50.415
But if I'm really going to die...

00:04:50.415 --> 00:04:52.876
...I want to pass on my genes!

00:05:03.386 --> 00:05:06.264
An emergency summons?

00:05:06.264 --> 00:05:08.600
Looks like everyone's here.

00:05:08.600 --> 00:05:12.645
Starting now, I'm sending
you on a top-secret mission.

00:05:12.645 --> 00:05:17.150
Fine with me, but please be more
considerate about how you notify us.

00:05:17.150 --> 00:05:20.111
So what's this top-secret mission?

00:05:20.111 --> 00:05:23.948
We want you to dig up a
certain thing in a certain place.

00:05:23.948 --> 00:05:25.533
What's this certain thing?

00:05:25.533 --> 00:05:26.951
It's top secret.

00:05:26.951 --> 00:05:28.495
Where's this certain place?

00:05:28.495 --> 00:05:29.746
It's top secret.

00:05:29.746 --> 00:05:31.664
A-Are we gonna dig?!

00:05:31.664 --> 00:05:32.874
It's top secret.

00:05:32.874 --> 00:05:33.958
Huh?

00:05:33.958 --> 00:05:35.960
You'll leave tomorrow morning.

00:05:35.960 --> 00:05:39.422
The necessary equipment and
preparations for your mission

00:05:39.422 --> 00:05:41.966
are detailed in this Strategy Guide.

00:05:41.966 --> 00:05:44.219
This is absolutely a top-secret mission.

00:05:44.219 --> 00:05:46.638
Make sure you never tell anyone about this.

00:05:46.638 --> 00:05:48.890
Excuse me, Supreme Commander.

00:05:48.890 --> 00:05:52.435
You probably have vaguely noticed from
the time you saw this Strategy Guide,

00:05:52.435 --> 00:05:54.854
which quite obviously appears hand-made,

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:56.940
but let me tell you one thing.

00:05:58.483 --> 00:06:00.985
Bananas don't count as a snack!

00:06:03.947 --> 00:06:06.574
Wow! How pretty!

00:06:06.574 --> 00:06:09.035
Don't get so excited!
This isn't a school excursion trip.

00:06:09.035 --> 00:06:10.829
Awww!

00:06:10.829 --> 00:06:13.832
At any rate, these supplies...

00:06:13.832 --> 00:06:16.292
These bananas are kinda strange.

00:06:18.878 --> 00:06:20.505
What's this?!

00:06:20.505 --> 00:06:21.965
Seeds?!

00:06:21.965 --> 00:06:25.343
It seems that these are wild bananas.

00:06:25.343 --> 00:06:28.680
More importantly, where are
we headed to this time?

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:32.767
Beats me. Looks like it's
programmed in the Vector machines.

00:06:32.767 --> 00:06:35.020
We have no choice but to follow them.

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:37.397
You don't know our
destination either, Instructor?

00:06:37.397 --> 00:06:41.234
Besides that I am to lead the group,
I don't know any details.

00:06:41.234 --> 00:06:45.030
Even Instructor Donar doesn't
know about this mission.

00:06:45.030 --> 00:06:47.657
To think that they'd go
that far to keep it secret...

00:06:47.657 --> 00:06:51.536
What on earth is the Supreme
Commander trying to have us dig up?

00:06:51.536 --> 00:06:53.830
Could it possibly be...

00:06:53.830 --> 00:06:56.833
...the legendary... Mythic Aquarion...?

00:06:56.833 --> 00:06:57.876
What?!

00:06:57.876 --> 00:07:00.086
Mythic Aquarion...

00:07:04.382 --> 00:07:07.552
But if the myth is really true...

00:07:07.552 --> 00:07:10.180
Is it okay to dig up something like that?

00:07:13.016 --> 00:07:16.061
Looks like he's finally started making his move...

00:07:16.061 --> 00:07:18.938
...to seek out Solar Wing.

00:07:23.943 --> 00:07:26.905
The Mythic Aquarion is
buried in a place like this?

00:07:26.905 --> 00:07:30.909
It's true that this is a
good place to hide it, but...

00:07:30.909 --> 00:07:33.495
Dig it up?! This is a lake!

00:07:33.495 --> 00:07:35.955
Where on earth does the Supreme
Commander want us to dig?!

00:07:35.955 --> 00:07:37.874
Just stay there and stand by for now.

00:07:37.874 --> 00:07:40.502
--Huh?
--Until I give you your next orders,

00:07:40.502 --> 00:07:43.254
you're free to do as you please.

00:07:43.254 --> 00:07:44.756
So he says.

00:07:44.756 --> 00:07:46.591
We're free to do as we please...?

00:07:46.591 --> 00:07:48.343
Even if he says so, what're we...

00:07:48.343 --> 00:07:51.388
Oh, I see! That's why it says...

00:07:51.388 --> 00:07:52.681
Look at this.

00:07:52.681 --> 00:07:55.433
Things to bring--swimsuits?!

00:07:55.433 --> 00:07:59.729
For those who forgot to bring swimsuits,
there are some in the transport plane.

00:07:59.729 --> 00:08:04.275
Forget about the battle for
a bit and refresh yourselves.

00:08:07.696 --> 00:08:10.240
Wh-What is it?

00:08:10.240 --> 00:08:15.578
Instructor Suomi looks the opposite
of her usual defensive self.

00:08:15.578 --> 00:08:18.289
That's the allure of an adult woman!

00:08:18.289 --> 00:08:20.959
It's not unusual to see Zessica
wearing a daring outfit...

00:08:20.959 --> 00:08:22.877
--Sparkle!
--...but when she's in a swimsuit,

00:08:22.877 --> 00:08:25.463
she's got a different type of appeal.

00:08:25.463 --> 00:08:28.299
But of all the girls, the best one is...

00:08:28.299 --> 00:08:29.801
Yeah!

00:08:31.511 --> 00:08:34.472
Despite the fact that she's
wearing a rather modest swimsuit,

00:08:34.472 --> 00:08:36.975
she can't hide her big bang!

00:08:38.268 --> 00:08:40.395
Mix...

00:08:40.395 --> 00:08:41.938
Sparkle!

00:08:41.938 --> 00:08:45.525
It goes without saying that
Mikono looks cute in her swimsuit,

00:08:45.525 --> 00:08:49.112
but Yunoha is the real surprise here!

00:08:51.322 --> 00:08:55.285
Hey! Why are you guys ignoring me?!

00:08:55.285 --> 00:08:56.786
Mikono...

00:09:02.500 --> 00:09:06.880
The melody played by the
wind traversing the lake...

00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:10.342
It's quite a pleasant sound,
don't you think, my good friend?

00:09:10.342 --> 00:09:12.802
Is this really what we're supposed to be doing?

00:09:12.802 --> 00:09:16.431
Well, we're stuck here until the Supreme
Commander gives us his instructions.

00:09:16.431 --> 00:09:19.601
Let's just think of this as part
of our training and enjoy it.

00:09:19.601 --> 00:09:21.519
Training...

00:09:21.519 --> 00:09:24.606
Do we still lack something?

00:09:26.399 --> 00:09:28.068
Here we go!

00:09:28.068 --> 00:09:29.861
--To you!
--Okay!

00:09:29.861 --> 00:09:31.571
--Got it!
--Got it!

00:09:31.571 --> 00:09:35.241
I'm not saying this because she's in a swimsuit,

00:09:35.241 --> 00:09:38.620
but Mix... is really cute.

00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:42.874
Yeah... Mikono is cute.

00:09:47.295 --> 00:09:49.381
My genes tingle!

00:09:49.381 --> 00:09:52.217
This is no time to just be sitting
around here doing nothing!

00:09:52.217 --> 00:09:55.095
One, two... Attack!

00:10:00.517 --> 00:10:02.102
Andy!

00:10:06.356 --> 00:10:08.066
Ow, ow, ow...

00:10:08.066 --> 00:10:10.568
I'm sorry. Are you okay?

00:10:10.568 --> 00:10:14.572
Yeah. This little scratch is nothing...

00:10:14.572 --> 00:10:18.076
...compared to the pain I've
been feeling in my chest lately.

00:10:18.076 --> 00:10:19.828
Do you have a chest injury, too?

00:10:19.828 --> 00:10:22.747
Eh, no... it's not like that.

00:10:22.747 --> 00:10:24.082
There, all done.

00:10:24.082 --> 00:10:28.294
--Huh?
--But you might want to rest a bit.

00:10:30.088 --> 00:10:31.589
Mix!

00:10:34.217 --> 00:10:35.927
Don't go yet...

00:10:35.927 --> 00:10:37.929
For just a little bit longer...

00:10:39.014 --> 00:10:40.932
...would you...

00:10:40.932 --> 00:10:42.934
...stay here and talk with me,
just the two of us?

00:10:54.195 --> 00:10:58.742
What's taking Andy and Mix so long?

00:10:58.742 --> 00:11:00.452
Shall I bring these to them?

00:11:00.452 --> 00:11:04.664
Well, I think we should leave
them alone for a bit longer.

00:11:04.664 --> 00:11:06.124
Huh?

00:11:06.124 --> 00:11:08.043
Come to think of it, where's Mikono?

00:11:08.043 --> 00:11:11.129
--Oh?
--Zessica isn't here, either.

00:11:19.971 --> 00:11:21.890
I feel kinda stupid.

00:11:24.017 --> 00:11:26.144
Mikono...

00:11:26.144 --> 00:11:29.856
Somehow I didn't feel like
hanging out with everyone, so...

00:11:32.817 --> 00:11:35.153
We seem to be thinking alike today.

00:11:37.781 --> 00:11:39.783
Here. You're gonna catch a cold.

00:11:40.784 --> 00:11:43.953
S... Say, Mix...

00:11:43.953 --> 00:11:47.499
I'm more than aware
that romance is prohibited.

00:11:47.499 --> 00:11:51.711
But I think... I'll regret it
later if I don't say this now.

00:11:51.711 --> 00:11:54.923
Y-You'll regret not saying what?

00:12:03.515 --> 00:12:05.433
Hey, Andy...

00:12:05.433 --> 00:12:09.354
Mix! It can wait until the battle
against the Abductors is over.

00:12:09.354 --> 00:12:14.150
Well, that sounds like I'm
going to die or something.

00:12:14.150 --> 00:12:18.029
But it's okay! I'll never die!

00:12:18.029 --> 00:12:21.533
So once this battle is over...

00:12:21.533 --> 00:12:23.618
Um... How should I put it...

00:12:23.618 --> 00:12:26.496
Say it! Say it, Andy!

00:12:26.496 --> 00:12:29.541
Say, "I'm always digging holes,

00:12:29.541 --> 00:12:33.169
but this time, I want to
fill the hole in your heart!"

00:12:33.169 --> 00:12:35.547
A-Andy?

00:12:35.547 --> 00:12:36.881
Mix!

00:12:36.881 --> 00:12:40.593
I want to fill the hole in your heart!

00:12:40.593 --> 00:12:45.181
I want to fill the hole... The hole in...

00:12:45.181 --> 00:12:47.600
--Mix!
--Yeah?!

00:12:47.600 --> 00:12:50.854
I want to fill... your hole!

00:12:53.356 --> 00:12:55.358
Huh? Hole?

00:12:55.358 --> 00:12:58.570
That's right! Your... hole!

00:13:00.238 --> 00:13:03.908
Wait... I didn't mean that hole.
I meant, um... mentally...

00:13:03.908 --> 00:13:06.286
What am I saying?! I mean, mentally...

00:13:09.372 --> 00:13:11.708
Did you guys just hear that loud noise?

00:13:13.418 --> 00:13:15.253
You are such a pig!

00:13:16.880 --> 00:13:19.674
...in your... heart...

00:13:20.759 --> 00:13:26.097
You know... I think I've
always been envious of you.

00:13:26.097 --> 00:13:27.557
What?

00:13:27.557 --> 00:13:32.437
You're always straightforward
and true to your feelings.

00:13:32.437 --> 00:13:38.568
Since you're like that, you can
openly tell Amata how you feel.

00:13:38.568 --> 00:13:42.530
But, well, I went through
quite a bit before that point.

00:13:44.449 --> 00:13:47.619
Believe it or not, I actually envy you, Mikono.

00:13:47.619 --> 00:13:51.247
--What?
--You're always admirably trying your best.

00:13:51.247 --> 00:13:55.126
All boys probably like girls like you, Mikono.

00:13:55.126 --> 00:13:57.379
Th-That's not true.

00:13:57.379 --> 00:13:59.756
You're more popular among boys.

00:13:59.756 --> 00:14:01.257
No...

00:14:02.509 --> 00:14:07.639
When it comes down to it, I think
they'll choose a girl like you after all.

00:14:07.639 --> 00:14:12.977
Right... A girl who they'd
unconsciously feel a desire to protect.

00:14:12.977 --> 00:14:14.562
Zessica...?

00:14:18.400 --> 00:14:20.151
The sky is...!

00:14:20.151 --> 00:14:21.653
That's...!

00:14:27.409 --> 00:14:29.703
That's... a dimensional gate!

00:14:29.703 --> 00:14:32.330
Amata! Let's deploy the Vector machines!

00:14:32.330 --> 00:14:33.331
Okay!

00:14:33.331 --> 00:14:36.668
Abductors are showing up in a place like this?!

00:14:36.668 --> 00:14:38.169
Andy...!

00:14:39.170 --> 00:14:41.715
I did it...

00:14:41.715 --> 00:14:44.884
I've been completely rejected.

00:14:44.884 --> 00:14:47.721
I'm such a fool...

00:14:47.721 --> 00:14:52.058
Seriously... If there is a hole,
I feel like I wanna disappear into it.

00:14:59.899 --> 00:15:03.737
In the lakeside area of the ANA district,
a dimensional gate has opened!

00:15:03.737 --> 00:15:08.616
All the regular Elements are out?!
What the hell is going on?!

00:15:08.616 --> 00:15:11.202
Calm down, Donar.

00:15:11.202 --> 00:15:13.371
Director Crea! Supreme Commander!

00:15:13.371 --> 00:15:15.206
What's going on?!

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:33.933
What's with that Abductor?!

00:15:33.933 --> 00:15:35.477
Let's run, Mikono!

00:15:36.519 --> 00:15:38.021
Andy!

00:15:41.691 --> 00:15:43.443
Andy! What're you doing?!

00:15:43.443 --> 00:15:46.905
It's an enemy raid! Hurry up
and come out of that hole!

00:15:46.905 --> 00:15:51.159
Forget about me. Just leave me alone!

00:15:51.159 --> 00:15:52.660
Huh?!

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:03.672
Gokkan Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:16:09.928 --> 00:16:12.889
Aquarion Gepart!

00:16:16.226 --> 00:16:19.437
We'll deal with this weird Abductor.

00:16:19.437 --> 00:16:22.315
So, Shrade, safeguard those on the ground!

00:16:22.315 --> 00:16:24.192
Roger that, my good friend!

00:16:36.955 --> 00:16:38.248
It's cold!

00:16:38.248 --> 00:16:41.584
I'm from a tropical area.
This cold is really tough!

00:16:41.584 --> 00:16:44.963
You guys, evacuate to the hole Andy dug.

00:16:44.963 --> 00:16:48.049
If you're in the ground, you should
be able to stay out of the cold!

00:16:48.049 --> 00:16:51.052
Is the Abductor causing this blizzard?

00:16:54.305 --> 00:16:58.727
We'll be fine. I'm sure
Amata will come rescue us.

00:16:59.853 --> 00:17:01.354
Yeah.

00:17:07.485 --> 00:17:10.530
Dammit! If only we were
wearing our Element suits...

00:17:10.530 --> 00:17:12.615
Isn't the exposing power working?!

00:17:12.615 --> 00:17:14.993
Oh, no... It's too cold.

00:17:26.087 --> 00:17:29.382
Just how far is Andy going to dig this hole?

00:17:29.382 --> 00:17:31.760
Andy!

00:17:31.760 --> 00:17:34.012
Andy...

00:17:34.012 --> 00:17:38.725
I'm hopeless... I'm hopeless... I'm now done for.

00:17:38.725 --> 00:17:42.270
Andy's aura level has already hit rock bottom!

00:17:42.270 --> 00:17:44.356
The time has come.

00:17:44.356 --> 00:17:47.525
Now is the time to dig <i>that </i>up!

00:17:47.525 --> 00:17:50.695
Go! Andy W. Hall!

00:18:00.955 --> 00:18:02.957
What the heck is this?

00:18:20.433 --> 00:18:22.602
These sounds...

00:18:22.602 --> 00:18:24.979
They're traversing space and resonating!

00:18:28.066 --> 00:18:29.859
Th-This is...

00:18:29.859 --> 00:18:32.570
It's finally started, hasn't it, Fudo?

00:18:32.570 --> 00:18:35.573
The seeds that fell on the ground sprout,

00:18:35.573 --> 00:18:39.244
and soon they will bear many fruits.

00:18:39.244 --> 00:18:45.041
And then, they'll connect new
lives to the next generation!

00:18:45.041 --> 00:18:47.460
I-It's cold!

00:18:49.963 --> 00:18:52.465
Water?! No, it's hot water.

00:18:54.759 --> 00:18:56.136
It's warm!

00:18:56.136 --> 00:18:59.973
I smell sulfur. Is this a
hot spring or something?!

00:19:01.641 --> 00:19:02.642
You guys...!

00:19:02.642 --> 00:19:04.978
Ahh...! I feel like I came back to life!

00:19:04.978 --> 00:19:06.521
Huh?

00:19:06.521 --> 00:19:08.606
Whoa! Sorry!

00:19:08.606 --> 00:19:10.567
Zessica?!

00:19:10.567 --> 00:19:12.610
--Mikono!
--Amata!

00:19:19.492 --> 00:19:24.372
Konyoku Gattai! Go! Aquarion!

00:19:28.793 --> 00:19:30.962
Oh! It's welling up...!

00:19:30.962 --> 00:19:32.797
From the bottom of the earth...

00:19:32.797 --> 00:19:34.758
The power of life...!

00:19:37.802 --> 00:19:40.347
Aquarion Evol!

00:19:45.977 --> 00:19:48.188
According to ancient alchemy,

00:19:48.188 --> 00:19:51.399
putting both a man and woman
in the same pot and boiling them

00:19:51.399 --> 00:19:54.027
would cause each to compensate
for what's missing in the other

00:19:54.027 --> 00:19:56.988
and they would be reborn as one.

00:19:56.988 --> 00:19:59.991
All the Elements compensate for each other

00:19:59.991 --> 00:20:03.036
and become one in the hot water!

00:20:03.036 --> 00:20:04.454
Supreme Commander Fudo!

00:20:04.454 --> 00:20:07.499
So this must be the goal
of the training this time!

00:20:12.003 --> 00:20:16.299
Setting bathing together aside,
what purpose did these bananas serve?

00:20:16.299 --> 00:20:20.387
Bananas contain lots of plant
hormones that accelerate maturation.

00:20:20.387 --> 00:20:24.557
The snake who tempted Eve in the
garden of Atlandia once upon a time

00:20:24.557 --> 00:20:27.310
hid in a banana tree.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:31.898
Bananas are the fruit of paradise!
They are also the fruit of the sun!

00:20:31.898 --> 00:20:36.778
Once they ripen, they rise
themselves towards the sun!

00:20:38.196 --> 00:20:41.116
Ahh... It feels good.

00:20:41.116 --> 00:20:44.869
My body feels warm inside!

00:20:44.869 --> 00:20:47.497
It's warming us up!

00:20:55.422 --> 00:20:57.424
Aquarion has...

00:20:57.424 --> 00:20:59.426
...shed its old skin!

00:21:11.813 --> 00:21:12.981
Cluster...

00:21:12.981 --> 00:21:15.984
Mugen Punch!

00:21:22.490 --> 00:21:26.703
Smash it!

00:21:31.249 --> 00:21:32.792
They did it!

00:21:35.837 --> 00:21:40.091
The hole... The hole in your heart...

00:21:40.091 --> 00:21:43.094
A part of the Solar Wing...

00:21:43.094 --> 00:21:46.097
I've finally found it.

00:21:46.097 --> 00:21:49.768
But the main part is in a different place.

00:21:51.770 --> 00:21:56.441
The fruits of the sun are plentiful,
so you can have as many as you please.

00:21:56.441 --> 00:21:59.569
But Solar Wing...

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:11.164
Morning, Amata!

00:22:11.164 --> 00:22:12.665
Morning!

00:22:13.958 --> 00:22:16.419
Huh...? Zessica?

00:22:17.754 --> 00:22:19.839
Zessica, that outfit...

00:22:19.839 --> 00:22:21.466
What happened?!

00:22:22.676 --> 00:22:25.970
It's like I had a little change of heart.

00:22:25.970 --> 00:22:28.390
Oh, yeah. There's something I forgot to say.

00:22:33.269 --> 00:22:35.480
I got rejected by Amata.

00:22:35.480 --> 00:22:37.440
--What?
--But that's okay.

00:22:37.440 --> 00:22:41.194
If a love is reciprocated,
Aquarion will go out of control, too, so...

00:22:41.194 --> 00:22:43.488
I don't mind if it's a one-way love.

00:22:43.488 --> 00:22:45.740
I'll continue to have feelings for Amata.

00:23:02.882 --> 00:23:10.807
<i>I saw a white flower on a slope</i>
<i>on my way towards you</i>

00:23:10.807 --> 00:23:18.440
<i>Even after awaking from my dream,</i>
<i>I gazed at a sad sky</i>

00:23:23.028 --> 00:23:28.825
<i>This feeling lives on a leaf's back</i>

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:38.251
<i>I listen closely to the sound </i>
<i>of the falling morning dew</i>

00:23:38.251 --> 00:23:46.051
<i>God, the world you created is not perfect</i>

00:23:46.051 --> 00:23:53.850
<i>Here, every day many loves fall and die</i>

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:57.687
<i>This was my first time falling in love</i>

00:23:57.687 --> 00:24:00.982
<i>You don't even know it, do you...</i>

00:24:00.982 --> 00:24:05.445
<i>Even if you were on the other side of the earth,</i>

00:24:05.445 --> 00:24:08.656
<i>I wanted you to be by my side</i>

00:24:08.656 --> 00:24:13.119
<i>Even if you were going to forget about me,</i>

00:24:13.119 --> 00:24:19.209
<i>I wanted you to be by my side</i>

00:24:23.421 --> 00:24:27.467
I wonder what kind of girl I was...

00:24:27.467 --> 00:24:29.636
A strong-willed, gutsy fighter.

00:24:29.636 --> 00:24:33.014
That's right! I was strong-willed and...

00:24:34.057 --> 00:24:37.120
"Next Episode 'Rare Iguras'"
No! I don't get it!
